{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12669","headline":"引极三首 怀潜君 · 元结","name":"引极三首 怀潜君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海浩淼兮汩洪溶，流蕴蕴兮涛汹汹。\n下何有兮人不闻，深溢漭兮居潜君。\n彼潜君兮圣且神，思一见兮藐无因。\n思不从兮空踟蹰，心回迷兮意萦纡。\n思假鳞兮鲲龙，激沆浪兮奔从。\n拜潜君兮索玄宝，佩元符兮轨皇道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}